                      "color": "#000000"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "must ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "textDecoration": "underline",
                      "color": "#000000"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "perform a few additional configuration steps. Please refer to the \"Hyperlinks and Categories\" page for these configuration steps. Choose the options that correspond to your data model (Live Connection vs Imported and Column vs Row based).  Perform all of the listed steps for your scenario, with the exception of the steps that direct you to drop fields into the Hyperlink buckets.  Instead, you will be using the Sort Order bucket (see screenshot on this page), as well as the Category bucket, since Sort Order is dependent on the Category feature, even if you don't otherwise use Categories.  ",
