                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Using the Sort Order bucket in the Field Pane",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ".  Once the setup steps have been completed, in the Field Pane, drop the [Metric Name] field into the Category bucket; and drop the [Order] field into the Sort Order bucket (see the screenshot at right and also the \"Hyperlinks and Categories\" instruction tab)",
